# ============================================
# Security Notes (v3.0.0 - Zero Trust Policy)
# ============================================
# NEVER commit:
# - .env files with real credentials
# - .wrangler/ (contains local D1 state)
# - *.sqlite files (local database snapshots)
# - API keys, tokens, secrets (GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)
# - Private keys (.pem, .key files)
# - better-auth-secret.txt (if generated)
# - OAuth tokens or session data
# 
# Production Secrets Checklist:
# ✅ Set in Cloudflare Pages Environment Variables (NOT in code)
# ✅ Rotate BETTER_AUTH_SECRET quarterly
# ✅ Use different GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID for dev/staging/production
# ✅ Enable 2FA on Google Cloud Console
# ✅ Review authorized redirect URIs regularly
# ✅ Configure CORS headers for external API calls
# ✅ Enable rate limiting on Cloudflare Workers
# ✅ Review D1 database backups and retention policy
# ============================================
